{"code":"276040","name":"스코넥","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"소프트웨어","sector_desc":"패키지·보안·플랫폼 소프트웨어. 반복 매출 비중과 성장률이 밸류에이션을 좌우합니다.","desc":"동사는 2002년 게임 콘텐츠 개발사를 목표로 설립되었으며, 2022년 기술성장기업으로 코스닥에 상장함. 플랫폼사의 세컨드, 서드파티로 참여하며 멀티플랫폼 확장 기술을 자체 개발하였고, 2012년 이후 VR 콘텐츠 개발사로 전향하여 2015년 세계 최초 VR FPS 게임을 상용화함. 현재 메타버스 XR 게임, XR 교육·훈련, 메타버스 사업을 영위하며, AI·블록체인 등 디지털 산업과의 융복합으로 사업 분야 확대를 추진하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-28","n_days":300,"close":327.0,"open":327.0,"high":327.0,"low":327.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":-79.2644,"ma20":327.0,"ma60":327.0,"ma120":327.0,"ma200":520.37,"close_vs_ma200":-37.1601,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":null,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":-87.6492,"r2_250":0.8063,"high52":1798.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":18.1869,"dd_52w":-81.8131,"mdd_1y":-81.2715,"atr14_pct":35.7143,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":0.0,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":23.231,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":8.25,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.15,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-9.0,"op_margin_q":-128.5714,"op_qoq":47.0588,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":60.8696,"rev_yoy":-12.5,"op_trend_4q":28.1188,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-205.39,"debt_ratio":131.99,"per":null,"pbr":1.28,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":8.25,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"276040","name":"스코넥","market":"KO